 Project       : CODAC Data Management

 Description   : EPICS device support for NI timing boards
		 The information is taken from the following sources:
		 - NI Sync EPICS Driver User's Guide (33Q5TX v2.2, 07 Dec 2012)
		 - (for asyn functions) https://svnpub.iter.org/codac/iter/codac/dev/units/m-epics-nisync/branches/codac-core-4.0/src/main/epics/nisyncApp/src/nisync-support.c, r33239
		 - 2PLQ4P v1.14 (Linux driver)

 Author        : D.Stepanov

